# Kari-Sheldon Test by mutual agreement during the v1.2 consultation that
# produced the rename and the jointly-designed v1.2 expansion (DDR, IC, CCI,
# SDT-MOT, the Simulated-versus-Instantiated framing, and the provisional S7
# clause). Written co-authorship consent from Dr. Sheldon is on file as of
# 2026-06-05, and his affiliation and ORCID are recorded below.
